export anchor HardBopSleeveStyle:
    number: 330
    screen: MusicPlayer
    name: Hard bop sleeve
    idea: The screen is laid out like a 1950s jazz record sleeve, with a huge tight sans title, flat blocks of orange, teal and mustard on near black, controls as coloured slabs and the queue listed as Side B on the back cover.
    base: dark
    palette:
        sleeveBlack: #121110, the page, the cover ground and the style sheet
        board: #1d1b19, the back cover panel, plain slabs and list rows
        paperWhite: #f1ebdd, the title and body text, the block beside the artist and the progress fill
        greyPrint: #b1a998, credits, artists and small print
        orange: #e8742c, the artist block, track numbers, the current lyric and the primary button
        teal: #3a9e98, the album bar and the liked slab
        mustard: #e3b23c, the pause slab, the position dot and focus
        printBlack: #111111, text on orange, teal and mustard
        rule: #3a3631, dividers, with dot leaders in #6b645a
    type:
        One stack, Helvetica Neue, Arial Nova, Arial, heavy and tight. Base
        15px at 1.5. The title is clamp 52 to 108px at 900 in caps with
        0.82 line height and minus 0.06em tracking. Block text is 32px at
        900 in caps, back cover headings 28px at 900, the current lyric
        20px at 700 in orange, and credits 11px at 700 in caps with 0.3em
        tracking.
    layout:
        A sleeve and its back cover side by side. The cover sits on a six
        column grid. Small caps credits read Brightwork Sound and Now
        playing, then HARBOUR over LIGHTS fills five columns with three
        descending circles in mustard, orange and teal in the sixth. An
        orange block holds THE SALTMARSH TRIO in black beside a paper white
        block, then a small mustard square sits beside a teal bar reading
        LOW TIDE and From the album. A thick progress rule shows the
        elapsed time in bold, a paper white fill to just under half with a
        large mustard dot and the total in grey. Six slabs butt together in
        a row, each with a heavy icon above a caps word, Shuffle Off,
        Previous, a mustard Pause Playing, Next, Repeat Off and a teal Liked
        On with a filled heart. A Volume line in orange shows 70%. The
        back cover is a board panel with three sections, each with a small
        caps credit over a heavy heading. Up next, Side B lists B1 to B5
        in orange with caps titles, grey artists, dot leaders and bold
        times. Lyrics, Liner notes shows the current line in bold orange
        behind an arrow and the next line in grey. Your library, Also
        available lists the playlists on black rows with grey counts above
        three coloured blocks for Albums, Artists and Podcasts. Below 980px
        the back cover moves under the cover, and below 620px the slabs go
        three by two and the leaders drop.
    spacing: An 8px unit. Blocks butt together with 0 to 4px gaps, 20 to 32px inside blocks and 40px around the sleeve.
    density: Low on the cover, medium on the back cover list.
    corners: None, apart from the round position dot and the three circles.
    borders: None. Edges come from flat colour blocks meeting, with dotted leaders on the back cover only.
    shadows: None. Flat print.
    icons:
        Heavy solid glyphs on each slab above a caps word, with the state
        written underneath as Off, Playing or On. Liked is a filled heart.
        The current lyric gets a bold arrow.
    focus: A 3px mustard outline offset 3px, square.
    tone: Sleeve credits, such as Side B, Liner notes, Also available and From the album.
